  "bodyHash": "YZ9MnJ4s3co=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\r\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\r\n<p><span>「彈跳床加強」是一款讓床變得更有趣、更實用的模組。安裝後，預設可彈跳 20 格高，你也能在設定中調整數值。和朋友一起彈跳，或是打造一個只有靠彈跳床才能到達的高處隱藏房間，盡情玩樂吧！<br><br>預設情況下，落在床上不會受到摔落傷害。只要確保再次落在床上，就能隨心所欲地彈到多高都不必擔心。</span></p>\r\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\r\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\r\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\r\n<p><span><strong>bedsPreventFallDamage</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>設定玩家落在床上時是否避免摔落傷害。若彈跳力設定較高，建議保持啟用。<br><br><span><strong>bedBounciness</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.5，最小值 0.0，最大值 100.0<br>彈跳力的倍率設定。數值 2.0 可讓玩家彈跳約 30 格高；數值 100.0 則可彈跳約 4500 格高。</p>\r\n</details>\r\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\r\n<p><span><strong>彈力十足！</strong></span></p>\r\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bouncier-beds/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"558\"></p>\r\n</details>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>更彈了！</strong></span></p>\r\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bouncier-beds/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n</details>\r\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\r\n<p><span><strong>您可自由將本模組加入任何模組包中，但下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 倉庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
